{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24570","headline":"题牛相公归仁里宅新成小滩 · 白居易","name":"题牛相公归仁里宅新成小滩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生见流水，见此转留连。\n况此朱门内，君家新引泉。\n伊流决一带，洛石砌千拳。\n与君三伏月，满耳作潺湲。\n深处碧磷磷，浅处清溅溅。\n碕岸束呜咽，沙汀散沦涟。\n翻浪雪不尽，澄波空共鲜。\n两岸灩澦口，一泊潇湘天。\n曾作天南客，漂流六七年。\n何山不倚杖，何水不停船。\n巴峡声心里，松江色眼前。\n今朝小滩上，能不思悠然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24570.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24570","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}